nned Module.End.baseChangeHom RingHom projection supplies its already checked algebraic implementation without a fresh dependency theorem. The terminal statement concerns all K-linear subspaces of the original tensor order. T012 checks the Chevalley identities and equivalence to invariance under all linear combinations of formal generators, including characteristic 2. No eigenvalue-separation claim is made after reduction. All native bindings are implementation choices, not semantic approval."}
